SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                1000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  500
PrintEvery                    100

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeHenryCoefficients      yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.75
ExternalTemperature 77.0
ExternalPressure 1e4

Component 0 MoleculeName nitrogen
            MoleculeDefinition local
            WidomProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

